        "source": "PREDICTION, NOT KNOWLEDGE"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s34",
      "type": "RECAP",
      "narration": "So that's the whole machine. Text becomes tokens. Tokens become vectors. Attention weighs their meaning. Training tunes the weights. And generation predicts the next token, over and over.",
